<section class="section" id="faq">
  <div class="container container--narrow">
    <div class="section-title text-center">
      <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="product-accordion" style="margin-top:2rem;">
      <div class="accordion-item">
        <button class="accordion-trigger" aria-expanded="false">Is this a physical product?</button>
        <div class="accordion-content">
          <p>No, this is a digital PDF download only. No physical item will be shipped to you.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="accordion-item">
        <button class="accordion-trigger" aria-expanded="false">How do I access my pattern?</button>
        <div class="accordion-content">
          <p>After your payment is processed, you will receive an email with a link to download your pattern. You can also access it through your customer account.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="accordion-item">
        <button class="accordion-trigger" aria-expanded="false">Do I need advanced crochet skills?</button>
        <div class="accordion-content">
          <p>This pattern is rated as Intermediate. It assumes you have basic crochet skills and can read a pattern. The included video tutorial helps with the shell and V-stitches!</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="accordion-item">
        <button class="accordion-trigger" aria-expanded="false">Can I sell items I make from this pattern?</button>
        <div class="accordion-content">
          <p>Yes! You are permitted to sell finished items made from this pattern. We kindly ask that you credit MJ's Off The Hook Designs as the designer for online sales. You may not use our photos to sell your items.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "FAQ",
  "settings": [],
  "presets": [{"name": "FAQ"}]
}
{% endschema %}
